<title>BELGIUM: NMKN/SNCI TO RAISE BANK SAVINGS CERTS RATES.</title>
<headline>NMKN/SNCI TO RAISE BANK SAVINGS CERTS RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian NMKN/SNCI industrial</p>
<p>credit bank said it was raising its bank savings certificate</p>
<p>rates as follows from Tuesday.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	CHANGE</p>
<p>    one year	  3.00 pct	+0.20</p>
<p>    two years	 3.40 pct	+0.30</p>
<p>    three years     3.75 pct	+0.25</p>
<p>    five years	4.50 pct	+0.20</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
